### WorkFlow API — smoke test (VS Code REST Client)
### Rode `npm run dev` antes. Base:
@base = http://localhost:3333

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Login (seed: senha "123456" para todos)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name loginSupermarket
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "supermarket@email.com", "password": "123456" }

###
@superToken = {{loginSupermarket.response.body.token}}
@superId = {{loginSupermarket.response.body.profile.id}}

# @name loginFreelancer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "free1@email.com", "password": "123456" }

###
@freeToken = {{loginFreelancer.response.body.token}}

# @name loginAgency
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agency@email.com", "password": "123456" }

###
@agencyToken = {{loginAgency.response.body.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Cadastro de um novo supermercado
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Novo Dono",
  "email": "novo.super@email.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "(11) 90000-9999",
  "role": "supermarket",
  "profile": { "companyName": "Super Novo", "cnpj": "99888777000100", "address": "Rua Nova, 1" }
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Fluxo da vaga
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Supermercado lista as filiais e categorias
GET {{base}}/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/categories

### 3b. Cria a vaga com turnos  (troque branchId/categoryId pelos ids reais)
# @name createJob
POST {{base}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": "COLE_UM_BRANCH_ID",
  "categoryId": "COLE_UMA_CATEGORY_ID",
  "title": "Repositor - teste",
  "description": "Reposição dia todo",
  "paymentAmount": 150,
  "photosRequired": true,
  "agencyReviewEnabled": true,
  "shifts": [
    { "startTime": "2026-09-01T08:00:00", "endTime": "2026-09-01T12:00:00", "label": "Manhã" },
    { "startTime": "2026-09-01T13:30:00", "endTime": "2026-09-01T18:00:00", "label": "Tarde" }
  ]
}

###
@jobId = {{createJob.response.body.id}}

### 3c. Freelancer vê as vagas disponíveis e aceita
GET {{base}}/jobs/available
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}

### 3d. Check-in
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/logs/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}

### 3e. Envia foto (obrigatória para o check-out desta vaga)
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----w
------w
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="p.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./public/uploads/exemplo-comprovacao.svg
------w--

### 3f. Check-out -> vaga "completed", pagamento liberado automaticamente nas carteiras
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/logs/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}

### 3g. Carteira / pagamentos por papel (opaco)
GET {{base}}/payments/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}

### 3h. Agência avalia a entrega (só reputação)
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4, "comment": "OK", "approved": true }

### 3i. Supermercado quita a fatura com a agência
GET {{base}}/invoices/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/invoices/COLE_UM_INVOICE_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### 3j. Freelancer solicita saque
POST {{base}}/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50 }

### 3k. Agência registra falta (bloqueia o freelancer)
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Não retornou após o intervalo" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Checagens de segurança (devem falhar)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 401 — sem token
GET {{base}}/jobs

### 403 — freelancer tentando criar vaga
POST {{base}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{freeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "branchId": "x", "categoryId": "x", "paymentAmount": 10, "shifts": [{ "startTime": "2026-09-01T08:00:00", "endTime": "2026-09-01T12:00:00" }] }
